@host = http://localhost:5105

### Get Channels
GET {{host}}/api/notifications/channels

### Get Formatters
GET {{host}}/api/notifications/formatters

### Send Notification (Email)
POST {{host}}/api/notifications/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "email",
  "to": "user@example.com",
  "subject": "Hello",
  "body": "World"
}

### Broadcast Notification
POST {{host}}/api/notifications/broadcast
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "user@example.com",
  "subject": "Hello",
  "body": "World"
}
